p four hold 40% of revenue), so pricing power is hard to come by."],"mkt":["The shares are roughly flat over the past year excluding the latest month.","The price sits near the bottom of its 52-week range, 20% below the high.","With annualised volatility of 22% and a beta of 0.60, it is more defensive than the market, though its beta has shifted (1y -0.28 vs 5y 0.45), so read it loosely.","About $1.8M trades a day, enough to build a position.","In past sell-offs it fell 42% in the 2020 crash, 35% in the 2022 bear market and 56% in 2008."],"val":["The stock trades 32% below its blended-model fair value of $94.00, a meaningful margin of safety.","The fair-value models corroborate one another (dispersion 6%).","Earnings yields are thin: an EBIT/EV of 7.9% (vs the 8% bar)."],"prof":["SG&A jumped 16% last year, worth watching."],"hlth":["The balance sheet carries net cash of $7.6M.","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 9.51)."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at -15.1% over 3 years."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 3.9%, and institutions hold 19%.","It returns 6.7% a year to shareholders (6.7% in dividends).","It pays out 100% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":53,"head":"Avoid: its composite score (20) is below 25.","pros":["Trades 32% below fair value of $94.00","Net cash of $7.6M","Altman Z in the safe zone","Returns 6.7% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Composite 20, below the 25 line (gates 5/22)","Revenue shrank 15.1%/yr over 3y","Flag: thin EDGAR history (0y)"],"flags":["Its composite score (20) is below 25"],"need":[],"buy_below":79.9,"vc":{"base":94.0,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":94.0,"n_alt":2,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.0627,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":13.5876,"ev_ebitda":7.146,"pfcf":14.6331,"pb":1.7432,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0762,"div_yield":0.0357}},"ticker":"SBR","date":"2026-11-13"}